OL,3,GNEWSADelays as A1 closed due to
OL,4,Athree-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A1 in Lincolnshire has been
OL,7,Fclosed in both directions following a
OL,8,Fcrash involving two lorries and a car.
OL,10,FLincolnshire Police said the incident
OL,11,Fhappened at about 06:20 BST, close to
OL,12,FLittle Ponton, near Grantham.
OL,14,FThere were no reports of any injuries,
OL,15,Fbut police said the road was expected
OL,16,Fto be closed for several hours due to
OL,17,F"significant damage" to the central
OL,18,Freservation.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
