OL,3,GNEWSADelays as A1 closed due to
OL,4,Athree-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said the road was
OL,7,Fclosed between the A607 and B1174
OL,8,Fjunctions, with delays of up to 30
OL,9,Fminutes, external in either direction
OL,10,Fon the approach.
